import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 677 | Dual-Track Time Domain | Conversion Mechanism for Enlightened Predators in the Time Domain","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 677 | Dual-Track Time Domain | Conversion Mechanism for Enlightened Predators in the Time Domain","no":677,"module":3,"tags":["Enlightened Predator","Conversion Mechanism","Time Domain","Quest Sediment Domain","Anti-Predation"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise","514-Old-System Integration into Quest-Domain Process","05-Myriad-Race-Joint-Progress Basic Program"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0677_模块3-双轨时间域-时间域中的开明掠夺者转化机制.md","filePath":"en/0677_模块3-双轨时间域-时间域中的开明掠夺者转化机制.md"}'),a={name:"en/0677_模块3-双轨时间域-时间域中的开明掠夺者转化机制.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,h,d){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-677-dual-track-time-domain-conversion-mechanism-for-enlightened-predators-in-the-time-domain" tabindex="-1">Entry 677 | Dual-Track Time Domain | Conversion Mechanism for Enlightened Predators in the Time Domain <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-677-dual-track-time-domain-conversion-mechanism-for-enlightened-predators-in-the-time-domain" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 677 | Dual-Track Time Domain | Conversion Mechanism for Enlightened Predators in the Time Domain&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 05, 514 | Series: Dual-Track-Time-Domain Overview Deepening (Entry 11)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-to-predators-heng-yuan-zhou-does-not-wipe-them-out-but-gives-a-path-of-conversion" tabindex="-1">Introduction: to predators, Heng Yuan Zhou does not wipe them out, but gives a path of conversion <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-to-predators-heng-yuan-zhou-does-not-wipe-them-out-but-gives-a-path-of-conversion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: to predators, Heng Yuan Zhou does not wipe them out, but gives a path of conversion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In the old cosmos, the predatory faction and the symbiotic faction are life-and-death enemies: the strong devour the weak; the weak, upon becoming strong, devour the even weaker; the cycle has no rest. Heng Yuan Zhou does not deny the predatory faction&#39;s existence — among multiverse residual civilizations there must still be beings with predatory thinking — but it rejects the &quot;annihilate all&quot; solution. Because eliminating predators is itself a kind of predation (violence in the name of justice). The path Heng Yuan Zhou gives is the &quot;enlightened-predator conversion mechanism&quot;: let those predatory-faction strong ones who already realize the predatory road is impassable and are willing to turn to co-building complete conversion in the time domain. Six top-level axioms here constitute conversion legitimacy: anti-predation axiom does not indulge predation but also does not respond to violence with violence; republican axiom of Myriad Races acknowledges converters&#39; equal evolution qualification; collective ascension axiom lets converters become co-building forces; causal self-discipline axiom lets the conversion process not create new causal debt; law-first axiom lets the conversion procedure stable and recalculable. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. This entry sorts out the enlightened-predator conversion mechanism in the time domain.</p><h2 id="i-who-is-an-enlightened-predator" tabindex="-1">I. Who Is an &quot;Enlightened Predator&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-who-is-an-enlightened-predator" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Who Is an &quot;Enlightened Predator&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>An enlightened predator is not an ordinary predator, but a predatory-faction strong one with three characteristics:</p><ol><li><strong>Already realizes the predatory road is a dead end</strong>: he has lived through the predatory-faction system&#39;s collapse (such as the Tang-Luo world&#39;s grace-system collapse, the Shrouding world&#39;s dark unrest), personally seen that predation cannot continue;</li><li><strong>Willing to think about alternative paths</strong>: he is not satisfied with &quot;swap in another strong one and keep plundering,&quot; but willing to think &quot;is there a non-predatory evolution path?&quot;;</li><li><strong>Willing to accept rule constraints</strong>: he is willing to accept Alaya-Network + multi-layer supervision, willing to publicly audit his past predation records.</li></ol><p>Three characteristics, all required. For diehard predatory-faction elements who refuse reflection, Heng Yuan Zhou does not force conversion, but quarantines and observes per causal self-discipline axiom.</p><h2 id="ii-five-stage-conversion-process" tabindex="-1">II. Five-Stage Conversion Process <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-five-stage-conversion-process" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Five-Stage Conversion Process&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_2-1-reception-and-loss-stop" tabindex="-1">2.1 Reception and Loss-Stop <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-1-reception-and-loss-stop" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.1 Reception and Loss-Stop&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The converter first enters the time domain&#39;s &quot;loss-stop zone&quot;: his predatory behavior immediately stops; resources obtained through past predation are frozen pending audit. This stage does not hold him accountable, does not humiliate him, but also does not continue indulgence. Loss-stop is the premise of conversion — you cannot &quot;pretend to convert&quot; while still plundering.</p><h3 id="_2-2-quest-domain-personal-experience" tabindex="-1">2.2 Quest-Domain Personal Experience <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-2-quest-domain-personal-experience" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.2 Quest-Domain Personal Experience&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The converter enters the Quest Sediment Domain, experiencing as a &quot;plundered one&quot; once more the suffering he had inflicted on others. This is not humiliation, but letting him emotionally truly understand predation&#39;s cost. The whole personal experience is conducted under Alaya-Network supervision; intensity controlled by ethical review.</p><h3 id="_2-3-cognitive-reconstruction" tabindex="-1">2.3 Cognitive Reconstruction <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-3-cognitive-reconstruction" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.3 Cognitive Reconstruction&quot;">​</a></h3><p>After personal experience, the converter enters the cognitive-reconstruction stage: systematically studies Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s five axioms, the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle, the anti-predation core treatise. Learning is not indoctrination, but letting him himself deduce &quot;if I had chosen co-building back then, what would civilization look like.&quot;</p><h3 id="_2-4-trial-building-contribution" tabindex="-1">2.4 Trial-Building Contribution <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-4-trial-building-contribution" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.4 Trial-Building Contribution&quot;">​</a></h3><p>After cognitive reconstruction, the converter completes one &quot;co-building output&quot; in the Origin Acceleration Domain: using his familiar deduction ability (the technical core of his former predatory ability) to produce a law increment for Myriad Ranks. The quality of this output is the key evidence of whether conversion succeeds.</p><h3 id="_2-5-return-and-supervision" tabindex="-1">2.5 Return and Supervision <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-5-return-and-supervision" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.5 Return and Supervision&quot;">​</a></h3><p>After the trial-building contribution passes ethical review, the converter formally returns to the Myriad-Rank co-building system. But his civilizational weight (Entry 671) accumulates from zero — past predatory merits all do not count. At the same time, the converter accepts an enhanced supervision period of one cycle, confirming conversion is real and stable.</p><h2 id="iii-the-anti-predation-essence-of-the-conversion-mechanism" tabindex="-1">III. The Anti-Predation Essence of the Conversion Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-anti-predation-essence-of-the-conversion-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Anti-Predation Essence of the Conversion Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h2><p>It must be emphasized: the conversion mechanism is not &quot;forgiving predation,&quot; and certainly not &quot;predatory merit gets amnesty.&quot; The essence of conversion is &quot;let predators become co-builders, converting the negative energy predation produces into co-building positive energy.&quot; The causal debt of past predation is repaid by the converter&#39;s lifetime contribution — this better conforms to causal self-discipline axiom than simply killing him.</p><h2 id="iv-contrast-with-the-eliminate-the-predatory-faction-route" tabindex="-1">IV. Contrast with the &quot;Eliminate the Predatory Faction&quot; Route <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-contrast-with-the-eliminate-the-predatory-faction-route" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Contrast with the &quot;Eliminate the Predatory Faction&quot; Route&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Predatory-faction systems advocate &quot;eliminate heretics&quot;; naive symbiotic factions may advocate &quot;reform everyone.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s conversion mechanism lies between the two: does not eliminate (that is responding to violence with violence), does not reform (that is abandoning principles), but objectively converts by the five-stage process — those who can convert are given a road; those who cannot are quarantined. This is law-first axiom&#39;s expression in social governance.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: converting a predator&#39;s technical ability for co-building saves more computing power and energy than eliminating him</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: loss-stop + personal experience + audit + zero-based weight, does not indulge any predatory benefit</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: in the Tang-Luo system predators and plundered are fixed classes with no conversion channel; in Heng Yuan Zhou five-stage conversion lets predators re-enter co-building</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the conversion mechanism faces enlightened predators among multiverse residual civilizations, regardless of race</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: five-stage process, loss-stop rules, supervision mechanisms all public; newly merged cosmos automatically applies; may infinitely expand toward the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The enlightened-predator conversion mechanism is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s mature expression of &quot;anti-predatory but not hostile to predators.&quot; It acknowledges the existence of predatory thinking, acknowledges the possibility of conversion, also acknowledges the difficulty of conversion. The time domain — especially the Quest Sediment Domain — provides a safe space for this conversion: understand suffering in personal experience, reconstruct paths in cognition, prove change in contribution. This is not benevolence; this is causal self-discipline.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./514_模块3-旧体系纳入求索域流程.html">Entry 514 · Old-System Integration into Quest-Domain Process</a> · <a href="./541_模块3-历史倒车模拟-掠夺派文明的通用倒车轨迹.html">Entry 541 · Predatory-Faction Civilization&#39;s Generic Reversal Trajectory</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">Entry 04 · Anti-Predation Core Treatise</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/05-万族共进基本纲领.html">Entry 05 · Myriad-Race-Joint-Progress Basic Program</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const p=i(a,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
